---
description: Always-on Quilr 2 DIE authority and durable-state rules
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---

- Read `AGENTS.md` before making changes.
- Read `docs/engineering/WORK_STATE.md` and `docs/engineering/TOPOLOGY.md`
  before planning or resuming.
- Use the exact authority commit recorded in `WORK_STATE.md`.
- Frozen contracts outrank existing code, historical branches, old PRs,
  comments and chat history.
- Never fabricate sensor data, identity, relationships, entitlement, coverage
  or evidence.
- Preserve unsupported and unknown states.
- Migration, policy, findings/intelligence, cost/value and deployment portfolio
  are outside this pass.
- Update durable state before stopping or context compaction.
